Bodytext 67108928 "Zig-Zagger takes Triggers from built in 'count analysis' and merges values with the 'Driver Channel ' (normilised:low,mid,high) which is then connected to the speed chop that gives out constant acceleration. At last it is zig-zagged with limit chop range. Trigger Lag applies here only on downs."
